	<key>PayloadDescription</key>
	<string>Disables Leo, Wallet, Rewards, VPN, News, Talk, Playlist, Email Aliases, telemetry and promo surfaces in Brave. Keeps autofill, translate, search suggestions, Wayback, QR codes, Speedreader and payment buttons.</string>
